350g water (70% hydration)
100g active sourdough starter
10g salt
4 hour bulk fermentation at room temperature with folds at 30 min, 1 hour, and 2 hours
Shaped and cold retarded overnight (12 hours)
Baked at 475°F for 20 minutes covered, 25 minutes uncovered`);
